{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Hrb2MuyWp71793634681.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>多部升降機出問題的瑪麗醫院新臨床大樓，部分升降機恢復運作。</p><p></p><p>該些升降機運作時，有職員負責控制。部分升降機就仍被圍封。</p><p></p><p>發展局指，目前17部升降機完成執修，其中7部驗收後，已按醫院需要開放使用，按目前進度預計，第四季內完成餘下升降機的執修。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.LIFT.QM-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261bE1E1GEdf1793634802.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>瑪麗醫院新臨床大樓去年11月起分階段啓用，今年8月被揭發28部升降機，只有4部正常運作，原因包括電梯槽外牆結構有偏差等，承建商未達合約要求需執修。發展局亦就機電署及建築署監督等問題向特首交調查報告。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:04.892662+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T15:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T09:39:14.167835+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T15:58:28.833148+00:00","content_hash":"592f48472a082647578c97853f96def52d59446b986811f2f7774c08cbb0cbea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:04.892662+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}